dding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"Power\">Power: </span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit;\">Solar</span></p><p><span class=\"attr-name J-attr-name\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\" title=\"Standard or Nonstandard\">Standard or Nonstandard: </span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit;\">Standard</span></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>2. Installation example</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"solar pump\" src=\"/Content/upload/2019348866/201901121548104671114.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>3. </strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Introduction of Functions</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The controller could monitor the following conditions and start the automatic protection at meanwhile:</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\">Misconnection of the positive and negative pole</span></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\">Overheating</span></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\">Short circuit</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\">Stator phase failure</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\">Low input voltage</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\">High input voltage</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;\">7. </span><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 24px;\">O</span><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: Arial; line-height: 24px;\">verload or lock</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\">ed-rotor in the pump</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; font-weight: bold;\">8. </span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\">Water shortage in the pump(External version)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 24px;\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"white-space: normal;\">4. </strong><strong style=\"white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Applications</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; box-sizing: content-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-senif; font-size: 12px; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 27px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.pronpeci14.i4.4a1a407cB7y0sc\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; vertical-align: baseline;\">For water supply from wells or reservoirs</span><br style=\"box-sizing: content-box;\"/></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; box-sizing: content-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-senif; font-size: 12px; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 27px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; vertical-align: baseline;\">For domestic use,civil and industrial applications</span></span></p><p data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.pronpeci14.i3.4a1a407cB7y0sc\" style=\"white-space: normal; box-sizing: content-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-senif; font-size: 12px; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 18px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 27px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; vertical-align: baseline;\">For garden use and irrigation</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231532518618815.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>5. Company information</strong></p><div class=\"page\" style=\"font-family: -webkit-standard; white-space: normal;\" title=\"Page 4\"><div class=\"layoutArea\"><div class=\"column\"><p><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">Jiadi is one of the leading submersible pump manufacturers from China. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">We always focused on top quality submersible pumps and motors since Chen Xianyuan founded Jiadi in Taizhou, Zhejiang, since 1988. </span><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT;\">The first pump was a submersible screw pump, and now, millions</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">of Jiadi pumps are operating silently and transporting precious water for people all over the world,<br/>and this number is increasing by million persistently every year.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\"><br/>Jiadi has already become the leading submersible pump brand in many</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">countries and regions. In the three decades, we have sharpened our skills and we never stop challenging ourselves to create more stable and reliable pumps for more global users.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\"><br/></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\">6. FAQ</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: ArialMT; font-size: 16px;\"></span></p><p data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.pronpeci14.i1.4a1a407cB7y0sc\" style=\"white-space: normal; box-sizing: content-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-senif; font-size: 12px; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: content-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: content-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 16px; font-style: inherit; font-variant-caps: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: 24px; vertical-align: baseline;\">1. Q:Are you a factory or a trading company?</span></span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; box-sizing: content-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-senif; font-size: 12px; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; vertical-align: baseline; caret-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\"><